                <pb facs="0154" n="46" sameAs="frus:frus1893/pg46"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Thompson to Mr. Gresham.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Petropolis</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1893-09-08"><hi rendition="#italic">September 8, 1893</hi></date>.
                        (Received September 9.)</dateline></opener>
                <p>Mr. Thompson suggests that a war vessel of the United States be sent at once,
                    declaration of martial law having been authorized by the Congress of Brazil.</p>
            </div>
